<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Bank FRCD deadline changed.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank FRCD deadline changed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The syndication deadline for Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp's HK$2.0 billion floating rate certificate of deposit issue has put forward to 5 p.m. (Hong Kong Time) January 22 instead of January 24, HSBC Markets said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The certificates will mature on February 12, 2002. They were launched on January 8 and priced at par to float at 30 basis points over the one-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 38 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
